{"id":452,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Has a brutish, ferocious temperament. With immense strength and a sturdy shell off which swords will bounce, it rampages about and wreaks havoc."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It’s so vicious that it’s called the Sand Demon. Yet when confronted by Hippowdon, Drapion keeps a low profile and will never pick a fight."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Its poison is potent, but it rarely sees use. This Pokémon prefers to use physical force instead, going on rampages with its car-crushing strength."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Diamond"],"text":"It has the power in its clawed arms to make scrap of a car. The tips of its claws release poison."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It takes pride in its strength. Even though it can tear foes apart, it finishes them off with powerful poison."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Possessing a sturdy build, it takes pride in its strength, taking down foes without using toxins."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It attacks people and Pokémon that cross the desert. This has only furthered its bad reputation."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"Its body is encased in a sturdy shell. Its head rotates 180 degrees, eliminating blind spots."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Battle Armor","hidden":false,"description":"Hard armor protects the Pokémon from critical hits."},{"name":"Sniper","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon's attack lands a critical hit, the attack is powered up even further."},{"name":"Keen Eye","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered."}],"eggGroups":["Bug","Water 3"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Purple","shape":"Armor","evolution":{"id":451,"name":"Skorupi","condition":null,"children":[{"id":452,"name":"Drapion","condition":"Lv. 40","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,40],[1,43],[1,422],